<PolicyPage title="Shipping & Delivery Policy" description="How and when Jhumka ships orders across India, delivery timelines and shipping charges.">
  <p>We ship every order from Kerala, India, to addresses across India.</p>

  <h2>Dispatch time</h2>
  <p>Orders are packed and handed to the courier within <span class="todo">[TO CONFIRM: 1–2 business days]</span> of payment. Orders placed on Sundays and public holidays are dispatched the next working day.</p>

  <h2>Delivery time</h2>
  <p>Once shipped, delivery usually takes:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Kerala: <span class="todo">[TO CONFIRM: 2–4 business days]</span></li>
    <li>Rest of India: <span class="todo">[TO CONFIRM: 4–8 business days]</span></li>
  </ul>
  <p>These are estimates from our courier partners, not guarantees. Weather, strikes and remote pincodes can add time.</p>

  <h2>Shipping charges</h2>
  <p>Shipping is calculated at checkout and shown before you pay. <span class="todo">[TO CONFIRM: flat rate, and the order value above which shipping is free]</span></p>

  <h2>Tracking your order</h2>
  <p>You get an order number as soon as your payment succeeds. Once your parcel leaves us, the courier name and tracking number appear on your order page, which you can open any time from <a class="underline underline-offset-4" href="/track">Track order</a> using your order number and the mobile number you used at checkout.</p>

  <h2>Wrong or incomplete addresses</h2>
  <p>Please check your address and pincode before paying. If a parcel is returned to us because the address was wrong or nobody was available, we will contact you to arrange re-delivery. <span class="todo">[TO CONFIRM: whether re-delivery is charged]</span></p>

  <h2>International shipping</h2>
  <p>We currently ship within India only.</p>
</PolicyPage>
